/-!+# Construction of the family in 15.4.12–13

The imports publish the canonical family, recover every member from its
actual quotient image, construct members from normal cubic quotient factors,
and deduce ambient normalizers and uniqueness from quotient normality.
The transfer argument explicitly selects an involution class missing the
index-two subgroup once its concrete two-class geometry has been proved.

The solvable Thompson quotient calculation, the application of E.2.3, and
the C_2 x S_4 geometry remain necessary for the complete conditional family
theorem. This module does not yet prove source 15.4.12 or 15.4.13. The final
discharge of the earlier chapter theorems belongs to Centralizer.Family.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
printed pp.1160–1161.
-/
